      <li><a href="/53-foot-trailer-dimensions/">53 ft trailer dimensions</a> — inside length, width and height of 53' dry vans and reefers (five Hyundai Translead models) in feet and inches, inches and mm, with volume and weights, the inside widths and heights Utility and Stoughton publish, a table of pallet and carton counts, and the US width and length rules. Three of the Hyundai Translead vans are in the container loading calculator's list; for any other trailer choose “Custom size” and type its inside size.</li>
      <li><a href="/semi-trailer-dimensions/">Semi trailer dimensions</a> — a summary of 53' dry van and reefer inside sizes, flatbed lengths, widths, deck heights and ratings from Utility Trailer and Hyundai Translead, the drop deck option, the federal length and width rules, and how many pallets fit on a flatbed deck one high.</li>
      <li><a href="/cargo-van-dimensions/">Cargo van dimensions</a> — the Mercedes-Benz Sprinter cargo van bodies: cargo bed length, width between the wheel arches, height, rear door, volume and payload, with pallet and carton counts.</li>
      <li><a href="/pallet-sizes/">Standard pallet sizes</a> — Euro pallet, EPAL 2, 3, 6 and 7 and the 48 × 40 in pallet: footprint, height, weight, safe working load and stacking limits, with how to enter a pallet in the planner. Its <a href="/pallet-sizes/#height">pallet height</a> section gives each empty pallet's height in mm and inches and the tallest loaded pallet each container and 53' trailer takes through its door, one and two high (no forklift clearance subtracted): use that figure, less your clearance, as <strong>Max height incl. pallet</strong> in the pallet loading calculator. Its <a href="/pallet-sizes/#weight">pallet weight</a> section gives each empty pallet's weight in kg and lb as the maker prints it, and how the gross weight of a loaded pallet (goods plus pallet) is worked out, also when loaded pallets are stacked.</li>
      <li><a href="/how-we-calculate/">How we calculate</a> — the loading method, the checks every plan passes and the sources of every figure.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

